#: kdeprint/management/kmwinfopage.cpp:34
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "ບົດແນະນຳ"

#: kdeprint/management/kmwinfopage.cpp:39
msgid ""
"<p>Welcome,</p>"
"<br>"
"<p>This wizard will help to install a new printer on your computer. It will "
"guide you through the various steps of the process of installing and "
"configuring a printer for your printing system. At each step, you can always "
"go back using the <b>Back</b> button.</p>"
"<br>"
"<p>We hope you'll enjoy this tool!</p>"
"<br><p align=right><a href=\"http://printing.kde.org\"><i>The KDE printing "
"team</i></a>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຍິນດີຕ້ອນຮັບ</p>"
"<br>"
"<p> ຕົວຊ່ວຍເຫລືອນີ້"
"ຈະຊ່ວຍໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງ"
"ພິມໃຫມ່"
"ສຳຫລັບຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານຊຶ່ງຈະແນະນຳຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ"
"ແລະປັບແຕ່ງເຄື່ອງພິມແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນ"
"ໂດຍທ່ານຈະສາມາດຍ້ອນກັບໃນແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນໄດ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ"
"<b>ຍ້ອນກັບ</b></p>"
"<br>"
"<p>ເຮົາຫວັງວ່າ"
"ທ່ານຈະສະຫນັບສະຫນຸນກັບການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້! </p>"
"<br><p "
"align=right><i>ທີມພັດທະນາລະບົບການພິມ"
"ເທິງ KDE</i></p>"

#: kdeprint/management/kmwizard.cpp:133 kdeprint/management/kmwizard.cpp:168
#: kdeprint/management/kmwizard.cpp:193
